            "<fieldset><legend>Traffic limit</legend>"
            "<p class=hint>Optional. Shows a bar on the Sites page and sends a Telegram alert at the warning level and at the limit. "
            "Nothing is blocked. The counter can be reset on the Traffic page; reports are never deleted.</p>"
