        "<span>metric</span> <input type=text name=metric class=mono value=2 size=5> <button class='btn pri'>Review change</button></form>"
        "<p class=hint>Next hop: a tunnel address (all of its tunnels that are up share the traffic), the same with @site for one tunnel, "
